}

body:json {
  {
    "nom": "Autre Arnaud",
    "email": "arnaud@email.com",
    "telephone": "+240 222 000 006"
  }
}

docs {
  Apres la remise a zero, arnaud@email.com existe deja (client 1) : la contrainte UNIQUE de MySQL refuse. Reponse 409.
}
